2.2  "Non-Commercial Use" means any use that is not Commercial Use. The
     following are Non-Commercial Use:
     (a) personal use by an individual that earns no money and does not support
         any business;
     (b) teaching, learning and study;
     (c) academic and scientific research whose results are published or made
         publicly available;
     (d) use by a registered non-profit organization, an educational institution
         or a government body for its public mission;
     (e) evaluation by anyone, including a for-profit entity, for up to sixty
         (60) days per organization per release line, provided that the
         evaluation is not used in production, does not serve customers, and
         generates no revenue; and
     (f) contributing to the Materials under Section 11.
     Grants, donations and tuition that fund an activity in (c) or (d) are not
     revenue from the Materials, provided the Materials are not themselves sold,
     licensed, hosted for a fee or made the paid component of any product,
     service or deliverable.

2.3  Rights not expressly granted are reserved. The Licensor claims no ownership
     of the data You put into the Software or of the results it produces for
